        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Storefront Door Lock Indicator</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAdams Rite 4089 style door lock indicator. For use with Adams Rite style <a href=\"/products/storefront-door-mortise-lock-deadbolt-body-th1101\"><b>Mortise Deadbolts</b></a> and <a href=\"/products/sliding-door-mortise-lock-hookbolt-body-th1102\"><b>Mortise Hookbolts</b></a>  on 1-3/4\" thick aluminum store front doors. Vertical actuator slide on back is in the down position when Indicator reads \"LOCKED\" in red letters. \"OPEN\" is in green letters. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nPackage includes one lock indicator, installation hardware,  header sign and instructions. Adhesive backed Header Sign has Black letters on Aluminum color background. Header sign reads \"THIS/THESE DOORS TO REMAIN UNLOCKED WHEN THE BUILDING IS OCCUPIED\". \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of Door Lock Indicator 4089-AL \r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Plate Height: 2-3/16\" (55.5 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Plate Width: 1-5/16\" (33 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Header Sign Length: 26\"</li>\r\n<li>Header Sign Height: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Aluminum / Plastic</li>\r\n<li>Finish: Satin Aluminum</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DC-LI-4089-install-instructions.pdf?v=1704262276\"><b>DC-LI-4089 Installation Instructions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold Individually</b>\r\n</p>",
